sfw": false, "body": "Hello again! How about a rabbit and alpaca this time? I imagine the rabbit being a tough lady, but with a heavy build like a flemish giant https://www.rabbitcaretips.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/what-is-a-flemish-giant-rabbit.jpg . The alpaca could be more serious than the rabbit and be a bit taller, but lankier. The context for the scene could just be a general feel of adventure, maybe they are traveling down a road, cautiously going a ruin,  climbing down a rope, or just making an action pose? Feel free to go wild with their colors, they don't need to match real life alpaca or rabbit coloring. Hope that's enough to go off of and have fun with!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hr_bananabird/works/46", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/40c6ed84/uploads/origins/66086e73-8b65-4da4-8aa6-32c7b409a3cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a74fce2cc72581583397b485a3aaa1e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/40c6ed84/uploads/origins/66086e73-8b65-4da4-8aa6-32c7b409a3cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a74fce2cc72581583397b485a3aaa1e, https://si.imgix.net/40c6ed84/uploads/origins/66086e73-8b65-4da4-8aa6-32c7b409a3cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e0affbf98a36735cf33e902072529f1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/40c6ed84/uploads/origins/66086e73-8b65-4da4-8aa6-32c7b409a3cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=46b63fd3e47a017809db4c011da408a9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "https://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/48550597_tVKGz8oNRTwMqen.png 私のキャラクターをあなたの感覚で描いてください!楽しい服、奇抜な服が好きです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hr_bananabird/works/45", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1305b79f/uploads/origins/1e466a68-e3f2-499b-918d-d95cc3b19cdc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8891295f3926c8a166